---
title: "forceLogoutAllAPI - Time-Gated API Route (AttendanceZen: Blueprint)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_time: now = toZonedTime(new Date(), 'Asia/Tokyo')
    q_get_time --> q_check_window: check if JST 22:50-23:50
    q_check_window --> q_outside_window: hour/minute outside 22:50-23:50
    q_outside_window --> [*]: return 403 Forbidden, "feature unavailable"
    q_check_window --> q_execute: within time window
    q_execute --> q_call_logout: await forceLogoutAll()
    q_call_logout --> q_api_error: exception thrown
    q_api_error --> [*]: return 500, "internal server error"
    q_call_logout --> q_api_success: result returned
    q_api_success --> [*]: return result as JSON

    note right of q_check_window
        INV-001: API is only accessible between JST 22:50 and 23:50
        INV-002: no authentication check on this GET endpoint
        INV-003: time check uses server-side timezone conversion
    end note
